[00:35.24]Seconds only pass you by 几秒飞逝而过
[00:41.69]A thousand reasons for me to turn off your lights 我有千种理由 熄灭你的灯
[00:45.38]
[00:46.33]You're violet crazy 你拥有紫罗兰一般的狂热
[00:49.24]It's what I'm meant to be 我注定要成为这样的存在
[00:52.78]There was no silence, baby 你我之间 亲爱的
[00:56.06]Between you and me 不允许有沉默相隔
[00:59.49]And it drives me crazy 这让我理智尽失
